"{#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format-1}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/multi-product-"
"formula/extracted-outputs/d751af7c-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/multi-product-"
"formula/extracted-outputs/d751af7c-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When executing circuits on hardware, we might encounter additional "
"challenges in obtaining accurate expectation values due to the presence of "
"hardware noise. This is not accounted for in the MPF formalism and could "
"play against the MPF solution. For example, this could be the reason for the"
" failure of the dynamic coefficients to provide a better estimate of the "
"expectation value compared to the approximate static coefficient in the "
"plot. That is, the approximate evolver, which simulates the approximate "
"circuit, does not accurately reflect the results obtained by executing the "
"approximate circuits in the presence of hardware noise. For these reasons, "
"it is recommended to combine different error mitigation techniques in order "
"to get results as close as possible to the ideal values for each of the "
"product formulas. This will show consistent benefits from the MPF "
"approach.\n"
msgstr ""
"Saat mengeksekusi sirkuit pada hardware, kita mungkin menghadapi tantangan "
"tambahan dalam memperoleh nilai ekspektasi yang akurat karena adanya noise "
"hardware. Hal ini tidak diperhitungkan dalam formalisme MPF dan bisa "
"merugikan solusi MPF. Misalnya, ini bisa menjadi alasan mengapa koefisien "
"dinamis gagal memberikan estimasi nilai ekspektasi yang lebih baik "
"dibandingkan koefisien statis aproksimasi dalam plot. Artinya, evolusi "
"aproksimasi, yang mensimulasikan sirkuit aproksimasi, tidak secara akurat "
"mencerminkan hasil yang diperoleh dengan mengeksekusi sirkuit aproksimasi di"
" hadapan noise hardware. Untuk alasan ini, disarankan untuk menggabungkan "
"berbagai teknik mitigasi error guna mendapatkan hasil sedekat mungkin dengan"
" nilai ideal untuk setiap formula produk. Ini akan menunjukkan manfaat yang "
"konsisten dari pendekatan MPF.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Overall, the approximate static coefficients still give a more accurate "
"solution than the product formula with higher number of Trotter steps with "
"the same amount of Trotter error in the noiseless setting.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara keseluruhan, koefisien statis aproksimasi masih memberikan solusi "
"yang lebih akurat daripada formula produk dengan jumlah langkah Trotter yang"
" lebih tinggi dengan jumlah kesalahan Trotter yang sama dalam pengaturan "
"tanpa noise.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is also important to note that in the example that reproduces the "
"experiment in Ref. [\\[3\\]](#references), the time point $t=3$ is beyond "
"the limit at which it is expected that the PF with $k=2$ behaves well, which"
" is $t/k>1$ as discussed in this [guide](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-"
"addon-mpf/how_tos/choose_trotter_steps.html).\n"
msgstr ""
"Penting juga untuk dicatat bahwa dalam contoh yang mereproduksi eksperimen "
"di Ref. [\\[3\\]](#references), titik waktu $t=3$ melampaui batas di mana PF"
" dengan $k=2$ diharapkan berfungsi dengan baik, yaitu $t/k>1$ seperti yang "
"dibahas dalam [panduan ini](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-"
"mpf/how_tos/choose_trotter_steps.html).\n"

